#MOBILE
Vnum       50040
Keywords   Dominic Ward Dom teacher~
Short      Dominic Ward~
Long       Dominic Ward, Lord of Knowledge, sits here reading, waiting for students.
~
Desc       Dominic Ward carries himself with a grace and confidence born from his
long life and many experiences in these Realms. He is looked on
with awe and unquestioned respect. That respect is well deserved.
Do not attempt to kill him, for you shall surely die.
~
Race       Human~Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc sentinel practice~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight~
Stats1     1000 1 0 100 100 0
Stats2     1 6 0
Stats3     1 4 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    8 10 10 12 9 10 10 0
Saves      0 0 0 0 0
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
Immune     sleep charm nonmagic magic~
#MUDPROG
Progtype  all_greet_prog~
Arglist   100~
Comlist   tell $n Are you ready for your lessons?
~
#ENDPROG

#ENDMOBILE

