#MUDPROG
Progtype  speech_prog~
Arglist   key~
Comlist   if ovnuminv(50020) >= 1
say You want the key for this door?
point north
say here let me open it for you
mpat 50099 mpoload 50123
unlock north
open north
mpat 50099 drop all
mpat 50099 purge
else
cry
endif
~
#ENDPROG

