ToRoom    50011
Desc      Lost in Terran Orbital Academy
~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    50004
Desc      Back to the beginning
~
#ENDEXIT

Reset D 0 50009 0 1
#EXDESC
ExDescKey    door~
ExDesc       You see a solid oak door.
~
#ENDEXDESC

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50010
Name     Human Discovery Chamber~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     You found the enclosed chamber. Hidden or closed rooms like this appear
throughout the game, sometimes with obvious clues and sometimes with very
subtle ones. LOOK, EXIT and careful reading are your most reliable tools.

The compact chamber uses bright ceramic panels, brushed metal ribs and broad
observation glass. Its plain construction is intentional: the lesson is to
notice access routes rather than rely on elaborate scenery.

Terran Union academy markings and neutral instructional signage line the compartment.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    50009
Desc      Wandering Terran Orbital Academy
~
Keywords  door~
Flags     isdoor closed~
#ENDEXIT

Reset D 0 50010 2 1
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50011
Name     Human Hidden-Route Passage~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     This passage introduces special and hidden exits. Hidden routes may not be
found simply by walking into every wall. Read descriptions, inspect mobiles
and objects, and look for words that might identify a door or route.

Locked exits may require a key or an appropriate skill. Directions can be
abbreviated as N, E, W, S, NE, NW, SE, SW, U and D. Some special routes use a
word such as LEAVE, CLIMB or ENTER. Continue north and use the next room's
description to find the concealed route.

The Human design language here uses bright ceramic panels, brushed metal ribs
and broad observation glass, making small visual details especially important.

The orbital station's clean composite architecture keeps the focus on training and navigation.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    50012
Desc      Lost in Terran Orbital Academy
~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    50009
Desc      Wandering Terran Orbital Academy
~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    50004
Desc      Back to the beginning
~
#ENDEXIT

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50012
Name     Human Heritage Salon~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     This chamber has been furnished as a Human heritage salon. A broad table and
twelve seats dominate the center while exhibits of Human maps, scientific
milestones and civic emblems line the walls. One wall display appears slightly
different from the others.

Use LOOK <word> on details mentioned in the room. Sometimes inspecting one
object reveals the clue needed to discover a hidden exit. The exercise is
unchanged mechanically; only the station's cultural presentation differs.

Beyond the station hull, Earth turns slowly below in blue, white and green.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    50011
Desc      Lost in Terran Orbital Academy
~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction west~
