ToRoom    50018
#ENDEXIT

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50023
Name     Human Final Navigation Challenge~
Sector   city~
Flags    indoors safe~
Desc     You are almost finished. The graduation hall is immediately north, but the
door is locked. The child here appears upset and may know how to open it.
Finding and returning the child's lost toy should help.

Hints: find the lost toy give the toy to the child ask about the key

The final challenge takes place beneath displays of Human maps, scientific
milestones and civic emblems.

The orbital station's clean composite architecture keeps the focus on training and navigation.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    50024
Key       50123
Flags     isdoor closed locked~
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    50022
#ENDEXIT

