#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50024
Name     Human Graduation Gallery~
Sector   city~
Desc     You completed the academy course. Proceed through the graduation gallery,
receive your diploma and continue toward the docking bay.

The gallery is a transparent orbital walkway attached to Terran Orbital
Academy. Instead of a city beneath you, the windows reveal Earth's blue
oceans, white cloud bands and the curve of the atmosphere. Structural ribs
frame the corridor while traffic lights from local shuttles move silently
beyond the glass.

Beyond the station hull, Earth turns slowly below in blue, white and green.
~
#EXIT
