#ROOM
Vnum     50025
Name     Earth Orbital Dock~
Sector   city~
Desc     This docking bay projects from the academy station so that training shuttles
can approach without crossing the inhabited modules. Guidance lights, docking
clamps and service equipment line the perimeter.

Beyond the bay you can see Earth's blue oceans, white cloud bands and the
curve of the atmosphere. A small shuttle is waiting to carry graduates down
toward Earth. To board it, use ENTER.

Terran Union academy markings and neutral instructional signage line the compartment.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    50024
#ENDEXIT

#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    50026
Flags     hidden can_enter~
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 50022 1 50025
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50026
Name     Earth Planetfall Shuttle~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~
Desc     You are inside a compact planetfall shuttle. Passenger seats sit directly
behind the pilot position, with a small service compartment at the rear. The
craft carries newly graduated students from Terran Orbital Academy toward
Earth.

Give your diploma to the pilot when requested. If you do not yet have one, use
LEAVE and return to the graduation area.

The orbital station's clean composite architecture keeps the focus on training and navigation.
~
#EXIT
Direction somewhere~
ToRoom    50025
Flags     hidden can_leave~
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 50055 1 50026
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50027
Name     Human Continuity Briefing~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors prototype~
Desc     The final briefing concerns character continuity and recovery after death. In
this setting death can carry severe consequences, so make use of whatever
medical, backup or continuity services the wider game provides. Update those
safeguards regularly rather than waiting until after a major loss.

The briefing chamber uses modular Terran consoles and standardized training
equipment, while a status display shows the orbital position of Terran Orbital
Academy above Earth.

Beyond the station hull, Earth turns slowly below in blue, white and green.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    50022
Flags     isdoor closed~
#ENDEXIT

