Name     Human Academy Program Service Room~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob~Desc     This sealed service room exists for academy mobile programs and should not be
removed. Maintenance labels identify it as part of Terran Orbital Academy's
internal automation network.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50100
Name     Human Academy Test Workshop~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob factory~Desc     A small test workshop used by academy staff. Benches, diagnostic ports and
modular Terran consoles and standardized training equipment fill the room.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50101
Name     Human Quiet Test Compartment~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob safe silence~Desc     A deliberately quiet compartment isolated from the busier academy modules.
clean white daylight-spectrum lighting and sound-damped surfaces make it
suitable for testing or study.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50129
Name     Human Isolated Test Chamber~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob prototype~Desc     This isolated test chamber is intentionally featureless. Instrument panels
from modular Terran consoles and standardized training equipment are the only
obvious connection to the rest of Terran Orbital Academy.
~

#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     50130
Name     Human Student Commons~
Sector   inside~
Flags    nomob safe~
Desc     This is the academy student commons, a final safe place to rest, read and
practice using the message system. Use NOTE LIST to list messages, NOTE READ
<msgnum> to read one, and HELP NOTE for additional commands.

The room is an open, multicultural commons designed for students from every
Human settlement. The station windows give occasional views of Earth's blue
oceans, white cloud bands and the curve of the atmosphere.

Terran Union academy markings and neutral instructional signage line the compartment.
~
